> On a different note, I found that ETCH 40r0 support for Voodoo3 3000 on
> DS10 all "just worked" in both 2D and 3D - no config file changes were
> needed, though the limitation noted above (1024x768) was also enforced.
> 
> So, bottom lines for Voodoo3 3000 16MB PCI:
> 
> 1. AC3 needs a software cursor enabled to run at all
> 2. AC3 won't run 3D at all
> 3. ETCH 40r0 runs it OOTB
> 4. 3D support for 16MB videoRAM cards is limited to 1024x768 resolution
> 
> Good luck.
